    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/86021b012dcabf4bd48f290f0d490ce2.poster.avif?t=1745905001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/86021b012dcabf4bd48f290f0d490ce2.webm?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/86021b012dcabf4bd48f290f0d490ce2.mp4?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Narrative Exploration:</strong><br>Dive into the story of the Nishimura family, a once-influential Kendo dojo lineage now facing a tragic secret. Explore the quiet countryside setting and uncover the haunting past that threatens to destroy the family\u2019s reputation and dojo.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/eb3440a31984a4173b20c9e4004b883a.poster.avif?t=1745905001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/eb3440a31984a4173b20c9e4004b883a.webm?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/eb3440a31984a4173b20c9e4004b883a.mp4?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Choice and Consequence:</strong><br>Players make crucial decisions that significantly impact the storyline and the fate of the Nishimura family. Navigate moral dilemmas and strategic choices that influence relationships, unlock different scenes, and lead to multiple possible endings. Every choice matters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/763579c82a7808e49053b1fb6f4da700.poster.avif?t=1745905001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/763579c82a7808e49053b1fb6f4da700.webm?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/763579c82a7808e49053b1fb6f4da700.mp4?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Relationship Management:</strong><br>Manage complex relationships within the Nishimura family and with other key characters. Build trust, foster forbidden romances, or create rivalries based on your choices. Relationship dynamics play a crucial role in uncovering secrets and driving the plot forward.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/24eee92e1eeac8955164a55c3c16df0a.poster.avif?t=1745905001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/24eee92e1eeac8955164a55c3c16df0a.webm?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010510/extras/24eee92e1eeac8955164a55c3c16df0a.mp4?t=1745905001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Unlocking Scenes:</strong><br>Progress through the game to unlock explicit scenes and significant story moments that delve deeper into the family's dark secrets and intense emotional experiences.",
